        "original_id": "4bf2dc5c-4d1e-5257-a058-7ee0f0b7e2ef",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kelly Preston, John Travolta, Michael B. Druxman, Mark Griffiths, Dan Haggerty, Pato Hoffmann, Michael Angarano, Danielle Panabaker, Kurt Russell, Mary Elizabeth Winstead, Steven Strait, Lynda Carter, Nigel Andrews, Arnold Schwarzenegger\n- Films: Cheyenne Warrior, Battlefield Earth, Sky High, Jaws\n- Topics: American Civil War\n\nFacts:\n- Cheyenne Warrior is a 1994 American film written by Michael B. Druxman, directed by Mark Griffiths, and starring Kelly Preston, Dan Haggerty, and Pato Hoffmann.\n- Cheyenne Warrior follows a widowed, pregnant woman stranded at a trading post during the American Civil War.\n- Kelly Preston is married to John Travolta.\n- Kelly Preston collaborated with John Travolta on the fantasy film Battlefield Earth.\n- Sky High is a 2005 film starring Michael Angarano as Will, Danielle Panabaker as his best friend and love interest, Kurt Russell and Kelly Preston as his parents, Mary Elizabeth Winstead as a popular senior, Steven Strait as Will's rival, and Lynda Carter as Principal Powers.\n- Nigel Andrews has written books on John Travolta, Arnold Schwarzenegger, and the film Jaws.",
